            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao wenene yatinisaga abantu. Nikyo araziikirwa omu batatahiriirwe, hamoi n'abaisirwe embanda, wenene n'abantube bona. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
